# Phase 6 - Async Behaviour Comparison

Java implementation uses asynchronous execution.

Verify:

- ExecutorService
- CompletableFuture
- Parallel execution
- Future coordination
- Completion handling
- Error propagation

Python must implement equivalent behaviour using:

- ThreadPoolExecutor
- Future
- wait()
- as_completed()

Parallel operations must remain parallel.

Do not accidentally serialize independent work.

